<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDEN AND FRANCE LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN AND FRANCE LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Friday's singles</p>
<p>matches in the Davis Cup final between Sweden and France:</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat Stefan Edberg (Sweden) 6-3 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Arnaud Boetsch (France) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>7-6</p>
<p>(7-2)</p>
<p>Tie level at 1-1.</p>
</text>
